        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Ley Line Empowerment"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, force, occult)\n\nRequirements: The myroga is within 500 feet of a ley line\n\nThe myroga wreathes itself in raw destructive energy converted from the ley line's ambient magic. The myroga deals an additional 2d6 force damage with each of its next successful fangs, tail, and talon Strike. Once its dealt damage with one of these Strikes, the energy is discharged from that body part, but not the others."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
